### PayVerse — transaction-service through the gateway. Prerequisites: 01-auth.http (token, PIN 4826),
### 02-user.http (min KYC) and 03-wallet.http (add money) for the payer; the payee also needs min KYC.

### Pay by UPI ID (201 SUCCESS/FAILED, 202 PENDING while the saga finishes, 200 when replayed)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payee": { "type": "VPA", "value": "{{payeeVpa}}" }, "amount": 250.00, "note": "Dinner" }

> {% client.global.set("transactionId", response.body.transactionId); %}

### Pay by mobile number
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payee": { "type": "MOBILE", "value": "{{payeeMobile}}" }, "amount": 100.00 }

### Pay a scanned QR (dynamic QRs carry the amount — omit it; see 05-payments.http to create one)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payee": { "type": "QR", "value": "upi://pay?pa={{payeeVpa}}&am=149.50&cu=INR" } }

### Transfer status (poll while PENDING)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/transfers/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### History with filters
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/transactions?direction=SENT&status=SUCCESS&minAmount=100&page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt&order=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### One transaction + status history
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Statement (CSV or PDF, max 1 year)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/transactions/statement?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Request money (by MOBILE or VPA)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/money-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payer": { "type": "VPA", "value": "{{payeeVpa}}" }, "amount": 300.00, "note": "Movie tickets" }

> {% client.global.set("moneyRequestId", response.body.id); %}

### Requests made to me / by me
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/money-requests?direction=INCOMING
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Pay a request made to me
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/money-requests/{{moneyRequestId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
X-Txn-Pin: 4826

### Decline (payer) / cancel (requester)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/money-requests/{{moneyRequestId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/money-requests/{{moneyRequestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Split a bill equally with two friends (I am included: 1000 → 333.34 / 333.33 / 333.33)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/split-bills
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "total": 1000.00, "note": "Goa trip", "participants": [
    { "type": "VPA", "value": "{{payeeVpa}}" },
    { "type": "MOBILE", "value": "{{payeeMobile}}" } ] }

> {% client.global.set("splitId", response.body.id); %}

### Split status
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/split-bills/{{splitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
